From 2f84abb936b11c5e5e0b30644a97b9651cc943e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 09:13:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper v1.9.7 - Traffic Analyzer per-network/Router
 attribution + dashboard client-list

Traffic Analyzer (rtrafd.c): two-pass poll_fcache attribution. Per-network is
now taken straight from each flow's own LAN-side interface with no upload/download
correlation, and locally-terminated router traffic (its own speed test, DNS,
firmware checks, latency probe - flows on the "_local" pseudo-devs) is attributed
to a new "Router" row instead of being dropped. br0 + Router + clients now
reconcile with the WAN line, and orphaned client downloads still land in br0.
Per-device client attribution (nf_conn[0] grouping) is unchanged. Fixes the
by-network panel never matching the live WAN chart, with accel on.

Dashboard (Main_ReaperDash.asp): the CLIENTS "View List" button now opens the
Devices page (/reaper_shell.asp#Reaper_Devices.asp) instead of the in-page modal
(removed); the client list grows to fill its card (flex column, 170px floor).

---
 release/src-rt/version.conf                |  2 +-
 release/src/router/rtrafd/rtrafd.c         | 82 ++++++++++++++++++----
 release/src/router/www/Main_ReaperDash.asp | 41 ++---------
 3 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

